<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
    <title>Order Confirmation</title>
    <style>
      body {
        font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif;
        -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
        font-size: 16px;
        line-height: 1.4;
        -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%;
        -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;
        background-color: #f4f4f4;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 20px;
      }

      .container {
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        background: #ffffff;
        padding: 20px;
        border-radius: 12px;
        border: 1px solid #ddd;
      }

      .header {
        text-align: center;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
      }

      .header h1 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 26px;
        color: #333;
      }

      .order-details {
        margin: 20px 0;
      }

      .order-details h2 {
        font-size: 20px;
        margin-bottom: 10px;
        color: #555;
      }

      .order-details p {
        margin: 5px 0;
        color: #444;
      }

      .items {
        border-top: 1px solid #ddd;
        margin-top: 15px;
        padding-top: 15px;
      }

      .item {
        margin-bottom: 10px;
      }

      .item-name {
        font-weight: bold;
      }

      .footer {
        text-align: center;
        margin-top: 30px;
        color: #777;
        font-size: 14px;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="header">
        <h1>Order Confirmation</h1>
      </div>

      <p>Hi {{customerName}},</p>
      <p>Thank you for your order! Your order has been placed successfully. Here are your order details:</p>

      <div class="order-details">
        <h2>Order Summary</h2>
        <p><strong>Order Number:</strong> {{orderNumber}}</p>
        {{!-- <p><strong>Order Date:</strong> {{orderDate}}</p> --}}
        <p><strong>Total Amount:</strong> {{orderTotal}}</p>

        <div class="items">
          <h3>Items:</h3>
          {{#each items}}
            <div class="item">
              <p class="item-name">{{name}}</p>
              <p>Quantity: {{quantity}}</p>
              <p>Price: {{price}}</p>
            </div>
          {{/each}}
        </div>
      </div>

      <p>If you have any questions or need assistance, feel free to reach out to our support team.</p>

      <div class="footer">
        <p>Thank you for shopping with us!</p>
        <p>&copy; {{year}} Store name</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
